00:11:06.950 --> 00:11:10.130
I also finished
setting up my local SSH

00:11:10.130 --> 00:11:16.250
key, which is what Ansible will
be using to talk to the VMs.

00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:21.160
So let's go to the
actual fun stuff.

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:26.570
First, let's take a look at
