00:12:13.070 --> 00:12:15.650
The connection is alive.

00:12:15.650 --> 00:12:17.910
Cool.

00:12:17.910 --> 00:12:18.410
Great.

00:12:18.410 --> 00:12:21.080
The connections-- looks OK.

00:12:21.080 --> 00:12:24.890
So now let's dive a little
